# Pressing Enter at the end of a task opens a new task below, so an errand list is typed in one go.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
END
see Post office
keys j <Enter> <Enter>
type Bank
keys <Enter>
type Pharmacy
keys <Esc>
see - Pharmacy
quit
saved <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
	- Bank
	- Pharmacy
END
